Turn your body into pure flame, increasing your fire resistance by [25%, 34%, 41%, 47%, 52% (TL1-5; SP 100)], burning any creatures striking you in melee for [14, 19, 22, 26, 28 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage, and randomly launching up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] slow-moving fire bolt(s) per turn at targets in sight, each dealing [41, 55, 66, 75, 83 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage.

The projectiles safely go through your friends without harming them.

The damage and resistance will increase with your Spellpower.
